 After a game is finished the big screen lists every player by points, then by total correct-answer time (`answers.duration_ms`, lower wins). Phones show "Place N of M" and the points, and "You won!" if they are a winner. Top N, Draw, and Reset winners are on the big screen and update both screens live. See `docs/prizes.md`.
